Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.00,0:00:36.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}Comparei quatro tarefas, em diferentes\Nescalas de tempo.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.00,0:00:41.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}Na tarefa horária, 336 horas formam duas\Nsemanas de histórico.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.50,0:00:47.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}A rede prevê as próximas 72 horas: três\Ndias de irradiância.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.00,0:00:52.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}Na diária, 365 valores representam um ano\Nde histórico.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.50,0:00:55.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}A saída prevê os próximos trinta dias,
